What was taken (verified by content hash against upstream `main`)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
* `deploy/include/**` — copied unchanged from upstream `deploy/include/**`.
* `deploy/g1_29dof/main.cpp`, `include/Types.h`, `src/State_RLBase.cpp`,
  `src/State_Mimic.cpp`, `include/State_Mimic.h` — copied unchanged from
